---
Match an exact checkpoint to your accelerator. Check the
[host and backend requirements]($link.page('llmd/reference/compatibility'))
and allow memory for both the model weights and KV cache.

# [Checkpoint catalog]($heading.id('choose-a-checkpoint'))

The routine test set covers 12 checkpoints and 18 configurations across CUDA,
ROCm, Metal, oneAPI, TPU, and Furiosa RNGD. Each checkpoint has a standard
configuration. Two also have native MTP and four have a separate drafter.
These are test targets. A passing result requires a recorded run for the
exact checkpoint, backend, decoding mode, and LLMD build.

Filter by **Decision** to find `LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B` and the eight StartLux
Decision v1.1 checkpoints. **Configure launch** opens the
[LLMD quickstart]($link.page('llmd/quickstart')) with the selected checkpoint
and backend. The [Decision guide]($link.page('llmd/decision')) explains the
generated request for `POST /v1/systemone`. The StartLux family has
five Instant and three AutoThink checkpoints. StartLux configurations await
verification on a specific LLMD build and backend.

Filter by **Embeddings** for `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B`. Choose your backend,
then **Configure launch** to open the quickstart with a request for
`POST /v1/embeddings`. The [text similarity guide]($link.page('llmd/text-similarity'))
shows how to compare the returned vectors. Backend-specific inference results
are pending for this checkpoint.

For chat, choose a checkpoint, backend, and decoding mode. The quickstart
uses LLMD's tuning defaults. Precision describes checkpoint weights.
**Target** means the precision is unspecified. A dash means the combination is
unlisted under the active filters. Documented presets link to their own
settings and available evidence.

```=html
<div data-model-catalog hidden>
  <div class="model-catalog-filters" role="group" aria-label="Checkpoint filters" data-pagefind-ignore>
    <label class="model-catalog-field">
      Search checkpoints
      <input type="search" name="checkpoint" placeholder="Checkpoint, family, or drafter" autocomplete="off">
    </label>
    <label class="model-catalog-field">
      Capability
      <select name="capability">
        <option value="">All capabilities</option>
        <option value="chat">Chat</option>
        <option value="decision">Decision</option>
        <option value="embeddings">Embeddings</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label class="model-catalog-field">
      Backend
      <select name="backend"><option value="">All backends</option></select>
    </label>
    <label class="model-catalog-field">
      Precision
      <select name="precision"><option value="">All precisions</option></select>
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="model-catalog-status" role="status" data-pagefind-ignore></p>
  <p data-model-empty hidden data-pagefind-ignore>No checkpoints match these filters.</p>
  <div class="model-catalog-navigator" hidden>
    <div class="model-catalog-family-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Model families" data-pagefind-ignore></div>
    <label class="model-catalog-field model-catalog-family-select" data-pagefind-ignore>
      Model family
      <select name="family" aria-controls="model-catalog-family"></select>
    </label>
    <div id="model-catalog-family" role="region" aria-labelledby="model-catalog-family-heading">
      <div class="model-catalog-family-title" data-pagefind-ignore>
        <h3 id="model-catalog-family-heading"></h3>
        <span data-model-family-count></span>
      </div>
      <div id="model-catalog-recipe" class="model-catalog-recipe" hidden data-pagefind-ignore>
        <div aria-live="polite">
          <strong><code data-model-checkpoint></code></strong>
          <span data-model-details></span>
        </div>
        <div data-model-routine hidden>
          <div class="model-catalog-configure">
            <label class="model-catalog-field" data-model-request hidden>Request type
              <select name="request"></select>
            </label>
            <label class="model-catalog-field">Decoding mode
              <select name="decoding" aria-describedby="model-catalog-drafter"></select>
            </label>
            <a data-model-configure>Configure launch</a>
          </div>
          <span id="model-catalog-drafter" data-model-drafter></span>
        </div>
        <div class="model-catalog-links" data-model-links></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

